conversation(display_name="Cedric")
  case lastResponse
    when "nice_to_meet"
    when "you_seem_nice"
      statement#final
      responses

    when "who_are_you"
      statement#cedric
      responses
        response#nice_to_meet.
          Nice to meet you!
        response#you_seem_nice.
          You seem nice!

    default
      statement#default
      responses
        response#who_are_you.
          Hello, who are you?

  statements
    statement#default
      text.
        Welcome to the #[span.highlight Notary Confi] training room!
      speech.
        Welcome aboard the #[break(strength="medium")] Fog Owl!
    statement#cedric
      text.
        I help Notary Confi keep its appointments. Visit each terminal: send the reminder, fill the WhatsApp template, read the replies, then fix the webhook to open the exit.
    statement#final
      text.
        Clients are counting on you. ¡Mucho éxito!